    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Set User Data').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "=Hello {{ $('Set User Data').item.json.username }} \nWelcome to our Customer Support Bot. I can help you with:\n\n**Order Status** - Type your Order Number\n**FAQ** - Common Questions and Answers\n**Contact Support** - Connect with Human Agent\n**Billing** - Billing and Payment Questions\n**Shipping** - Delivery Information\n\nJust type what you need help with or use these commands:\n- /faq - View Frequently asked questions\n- /contact - Speak to Human Support\n- /status - Check Order Status\n\nHow can I help you today?",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        300,
        0
      ],
      "id": "acf55a4a-4c12-47bc-919b-5c930ac7d603",
      "name": "Send Welcome Message",
      "webhookId": "3c7eeb1c-0d9a-4abf-b792-df10e66ba32d",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "R9mGZmc8vZRPEvhi",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Set User Data').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "=Hello {{ $('Set User Data').item.json.username }},\n\nTo check the status of your order, please reply with your **Order Number**.  \n\nFor example, type something like:\n\n<b>123456789</b>\n\nOnce you send your order number, I will provide you with the latest status of your order, including shipment and delivery details.\n\nYou can also use these commands:\n\n- /faq - View Frequently Asked Questions  \n- /contact - Speak to a Human Support Agent  \n- /status - Check Order Status  \n\nHow can I assist you today?\n",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        300,
        180
      ],
      "id": "be0d25a0-ca58-4a07-b441-6ce1705b1964",
      "name": "Send Order Message",
      "webhookId": "3c7eeb1c-0d9a-4abf-b792-df10e66ba32d",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "R9mGZmc8vZRPEvhi",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Set User Data').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "=Hello {{ $('Set User Data').item.json.username }},\n\nHere are some **Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)** that might help you:\n\n<b>1. How do I place an order?</b>\n- You can place an order directly through our website or app. Add items to your cart and proceed to checkout.\n\n<b>2. Can I track my order?</b>\n- Yes! Use the /status command and provide your order number to see the current status.\n\n<b>3. What payment methods do you accept?</b>\n- We accept credit/debit cards, PayPal, and other popular payment methods.\n\n<b>4. How can I contact support?</b>\n- Use the /contact command to connect with a human support agent.\n\n<b>5. What is your return policy?</b>\n- Items can be returned within 14 days of delivery if they are unused and in original packaging.\n\nYou can use these commands for quick access:\n\n- /faq - View this FAQ  \n- /contact - Speak to Human Support  \n- /status - Check Order Status  \n\nIf your question is not listed here, feel free to ask me directly!\n",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        300,
        380
      ],
      "id": "37c1538c-41da-446a-abc5-7da441d48597",
      "name": "Send FAQ Message",
      "webhookId": "3c7eeb1c-0d9a-4abf-b792-df10e66ba32d",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "R9mGZmc8vZRPEvhi",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Set User Data').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "=Hello {{ $('Set User Data').item.json.username }},\n\nYour request has been forwarded to our support team.  \nThey will contact you shortly. Thank you for your patience! 🙏\n",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
