        "text": "=Hello {{ $('Set User Data').item.json.username }},\n\nHere’s a summary of your billing information:\n\n<b>Billing Details:</b>\n- Account Name: [Your Account Name]\n- Billing Email: [user@example.com]\n- Last Payment: [Date / Amount]\n- Next Due Date: [Date]\n- Payment Method: [Credit Card / PayPal / etc.]\n\nIf you have any questions about your billing or need assistance, you can contact our support team using the /contact command.\n\nThank you for being with us!\n",
